   "h": 110,
   "rot": 0,
   "opacity": 1,
   "animIn": "none",
   "animOut": "none",
   "animDur": 0.45,
   "text": "¿Qué quieres que haga alguien cuando entre a tu web?",
   "size": 52,
   "capStyle": "pill",
   "maxWords": 4,
   "accent": "#FF6BA7"
  },
  {
   "id": "l44",
   "type": "caption",
   "name": "Subtítulos 2",
   "start": 2.94,
   "end": 6.69,
   "x": 540,
   "y": 1450,
   "w": 960,
   "h": 110,
   "rot": 0,
   "opacity": 1,
   "animIn": "none",
   "animOut": "none",
   "animDur": 0.45,
   "text": "¿Que te escriba, reserve una hora o te pida una cotización?",
   "size": 52,
   "capStyle": "pill",
   "maxWords": 4,
   "accent": "#FF6BA7"
  },
  {
   "id": "l45",
   "type": "caption",
   "name": "Subtítulos 3",
   "start": 7.3,
   "end": 9.49,
   "x": 540,
   "y": 1450,
   "w": 960,
   "h": 110,
   "rot": 0,
   "opacity": 1,
   "animIn": "none",
   "animOut": "none",
   "animDur": 0.45,
   "text": "Cuando trabajamos juntos, partimos por ahí.",
   "size": 52,
   "capStyle": "pill",
   "maxWords": 4,
   "accent": "#FF6BA7"
  },
  {
   "id": "l46",
   "type": "caption",
   "name": "Subtítulos 4",
   "start": 9.88,
   "end": 14.89,
   "x": 540,
   "y": 1450,
   "w": 960,
   "h": 110,
   "rot": 0,
   "opacity": 1,
   "animIn": "none",
   "animOut": "none",
   "animDur": 0.45,
   "text": "Conversamos sobre tu negocio, tus clientes y lo que necesitan saber antes de elegirte.",
   "size": 52,
   "capStyle": "pill",
   "maxWords": 4,
   "accent": "#FF6BA7"
  },
  {
   "id": "l47",
   "type": "caption",
   "name": "Subtítulos 5",
   "start": 15.47,
   "end": 20.04,
   "x": 540,
   "y": 1450,
   "w": 960,
   "h": 110,
   "rot": 0,
   "opacity": 1,
   "animIn": "none",
   "animOut": "none",
   "animDur": 0.45,
   "text": "Después reviso cómo se muestra tu competencia y qué podemos destacar de tu trabajo.",
   "size": 52,
   "capStyle": "pill",
   "maxWords": 4,
   "accent": "#FF6BA7"
  },
  {
   "id": "l48",
   "type": "caption",
   "name": "Subtítulos 6",
   "start": 20.52,
   "end": 24.88,
   "x": 540,
   "y": 1450,
   "w": 960,
   "h": 110,
   "rot": 0,
   "opacity": 1,
   "animIn": "none",
   "animOut": "none",
   "animDur": 0.45,
   "text": "Con eso ordeno las fotos y los textos, y te muestro cómo quedaría tu web.",
   "size": 52,
   "capStyle": "pill",
   "maxWords": 4,
   "accent": "#FF6BA7"
  },
  {
   "id": "l49",
   "type": "caption",
   "name": "Subtítulos 7",
   "start": 25.32,
   "end": 27.37,
   "x": 540,
   "y": 1450,
   "w": 960,
   "h": 110,
   "rot": 0,
   "opacity": 1,
   "animIn": "none",
   "animOut": "none",
   "animDur": 0.45,
   "text": "Cuando apruebas el diseño, la construyo.",
   "size": 52,
   "capStyle": "pill",
   "maxWords": 4,
   "accent": "#FF6BA7"
  },
  {
   "id": "l50",
   "type": "caption",
   "name": "Subtítulos 8",
   "start": 27.78,
   "end": 31.08,
   "x": 540,
   "y": 1450,
   "w": 960,
   "h": 110,
   "rot": 0,
   "opacity": 1,
   "animIn": "none",
   "animOut": "none",
   "animDur": 0.45,
   "text": "Me aseguro de que cargue rápido y de que sea fácil contactarte.",
   "size": 52,
   "capStyle": "pill",
   "maxWords": 4,
   "accent": "#FF6BA7"
  },
  {
   "id": "l51",
   "type": "caption",
   "name": "Subtítulos 9",
   "start": 31.68,
   "end": 36.43,
   "x": 540,
   "y": 1450,
   "w": 960,
   "h": 110,
   "rot": 0,
   "opacity": 1,
   "animIn": "none",
   "animOut": "none",
   "animDur": 0.45,
   "text": "Al entregártela, te enseño a actualizarla y te acompaño durante los primeros 30 días.",
   "size": 52,
   "capStyle": "pill",
   "maxWords": 4,
   "accent": "#FF6BA7"
  },
  {
   "id": "l52",
